     "summary": "Simpson and Bruckheimer, Tony Scott, Zemeckis, McTiernan: the film that can be summarized in a single sentence, edited like an MTV clip, sold on its soundtrack and its star. Top Gun, Back to the Future, Die Hard, Batman.",
