     "summary": "Yellow Earth, Horse Thief, Red Sorghum, Ju Dou, Raise the Red Lantern: rural and ritual China, in wide shots, symbolic colors, and few words. An allegory of the nation for the festivals, a critique of feudalism for the censors.",
